{
  "name": "Form response to Claude summary to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Form response to Claude summary to Slack\n\nA form response arrives (Typeform, Tally, your landing page), **Claude** **summarizes** it, detects the intent and sets a **priority**, then it is logged to Sheets and posted to **Slack**.\n\n**How it works:** webhook, empty bodies discarded, Claude summary with structured output, normalized fields, Google Sheets row, Slack message.\n\n**You need:** an **Anthropic (Claude)** credential, a Slack **Incoming Webhook URL** and Google Sheets.\n\n*Works with any form provider:* the whole body is sent to Claude, so field names do not matter.\n\nFree template from kyndredai.com/templates. Runs on n8n 2.x, self-hosted or cloud.",
        "height": 291,
        "width": 1884,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        49
      ],
      "id": "8746ed8c-de63-4bda-a2b1-c133f270274e",
      "name": "README"
    },
